flowchart TB
    subgraph Browser[Client / Browser]
        UI[Next.js Frontend<br/>React 19 + Tiptap Editor<br/>Tailwind + shadcn/ui]
        UI -.SSE.-> SSEClient[SSE Token Stream]
    end

    subgraph BFF[Next.js App - Backend for Frontend BFF]
